Output "out/hero.gif"
Source theme.tape
Set Height 1100
Hide
Type `asciinema rec -q --overwrite -i 3 -c "kit tui --root $KIT_DEMO_ROOT" out/hero.cast`
Enter
Sleep 3s
Show
Sleep 1s
Type "The unit tests fail. Find the bug, fix it, and run the tests again."
Sleep 500ms
Enter
Sleep 40s
Hide
Ctrl+C
Sleep 1s
